Tatou API Fuzzing Campaign
Group: SoftSec Group 10
Target: GET /api/get-version/<link>
Evidence: fuzz_get_version_results.csv, fuzz_results_run1.csv

Campaign summary:
- 229 requests in the run including the valid positive control.
- 228 requests in the earlier run without the positive control.
- No HTTP 5xx responses were observed.
- Uppercase and trailing-space variants of a valid link returned HTTP 200.
- Exact link-matching behavior requires further investigation.

Limitations:
- Results apply only to the inputs and environment tested.
- No HTTP 5xx responses do not prove the endpoint is secure.
- The exact link-matching issue remains unresolved.

Note:
This is a written summary of recorded results, not a raw terminal execution log.
